{{!-- Create a digest summary of recent alerts --}}
Create a concise daily digest summary of these alerts for the user.

Alerts:
{{#each alerts}}
- **{{this.title}}** (Watch: "{{this.watchDescription}}")
  {{#if this.fullContent}}
  Report: {{this.fullContent}}
  {{else}}
  {{this.snippet}}
  {{/if}}
  Why: {{this.explanation}}
  Source: {{this.sourceName}}
{{/each}}

Group related alerts together. For each group:
- Lead with the most important item
- Be concise but informative
- Include key details from the reports (numbers, dates, names) — don't just say "an article was found"
- Include why each item matters based on the user's watch

Keep the total summary under 500 words. Use markdown formatting.
